@startuml

actor "前台用户" as User
participant "Frontend" as Frontend
participant "Backend Controller" as BackendController
participant "Backend Service" as BackendService
participant "Database" as Database

User -> Frontend: 发起领养动物请求
Frontend -> BackendController: 发起修改动物状态请求
BackendController -> BackendService: 调用updateById方法
BackendService -> Database: 更新动物状态
Database --> BackendService: 返回更新结果
BackendService --> BackendController: 返回更新结果
BackendController --> Frontend: 返回更新结果
Frontend -> BackendController: 发起添加领养记录请求
BackendController -> BackendService: 调用add方法
BackendService -> Database: 插入领养记录
Database --> BackendService: 返回领养结果
BackendService --> BackendController: 返回领养结果
BackendController --> Frontend: 返回领养结果
Frontend --> User: 返回领养结果
@enduml
